chx:X_ShowViewer a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ShowViewer ; rdfs:label "im.show()"@en ; skos:definition "Image.show() writes the picture to a temporary file and starts a viewer program, and returns None; on this Linux machine Pillow lists XDGViewer and DisplayViewer first, so on a machine with no viewer on the PATH, as in the headless replay of this study, the call returned None, showed nothing and raised no error."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
