chx:X_PieChart a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:PieChart ; rdfs:label "plt.pie(slices, labels=labels, autopct='%.1f%%')"@en ; skos:definition "plt.pie() draws one wedge for each number and returns a PieContainer in Matplotlib 3.11.2 and a tuple in 3.10 and earlier; the container still unpacks into 3 parts with autopct and 2 without it, len() of it raises TypeError, the percent texts are '10.0%' to '40.0%' and the first wedge runs from 0 to 36 degrees."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
