chx:X_SaveFigure a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SaveFigure ; rdfs:label "plt.savefig('linegraph.png')"@en ; skos:definition "plt.savefig() writes the current figure: the default PNG is 640 by 480 pixels in mode RGBA with a density of 100 dots per inch, and dpi=200 gives 1280 by 960; the call belongs before plt.show(), as the chapter says, and takes the figure as it is at that moment."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
