chx:X_AppendixBErrors a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:AppendixBErrors ; rdfs:label "im.crop((0, 50, 50, 50))"@en ; skos:definition "Appendix B answers question 6 with im.crop((0, 50, 50, 50)), which has the size (50, 0) because bottom equals top, while (0, 50, 50, 100) gives the 50 by 50 lower-left quarter; question 3 calls the box left, top, width and height although the chapter says right and bottom, and question 12 says plt.show() resets the data, true only for a window."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
