chx:X_TextsizeGone a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:TextsizeGone ; rdfs:label "hasattr(ImageDraw.ImageDraw, 'textsize')"@en ; skos:definition "ImageDraw.textsize() and ImageFont.getsize() were removed in Pillow 10.0.0 and are False in 12.3.0, and textbbox(), textlength() and getbbox() take their place; the 2nd edition's chapter 19 mentions textsize 3 times, and this chapter avoids it."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
