chx:X_GetdataDeprecation a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:GetdataDeprecation ; rdfs:label "Image.getdata()"@en ; skos:definition "Image.getdata() gives a DeprecationWarning from Pillow 12.1.0 that says it will be removed in Pillow 14 (2027-10-15), with get_flattened_data() as the replacement, so the pixel-counting loops over getdata() in this study's programs are the first thing to change."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch21/research> .
